  "description": "PAFHAG crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C122 H118 Dy6 Mn6 N16 O60,9(C1 H4 O1),8(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Mn1 (Mn) has 4 O neighbors; Mn2 (Mn) has 5 O neighbors; Mn3 (Mn) has 4 O neighbors; Dy1D (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Mn1D (Mn) has 4 O neighbors; Dy2D (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3D (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Mn2D (Mn) has 5 O neighbors; Mn3D (Mn) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.677-3.954 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 100.81-125.04°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy6Mn6(H2shi)4(Hshi)2(shi)10(CH3OH)10(H2O)2]·9CH3OH·8H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
